---
import { climateSummary } from '../../lib/atlas-europe-view';

interface Props {
  city: {
    id: string; name: string; stationId: string; stationName: string;
    coordinates: number[]; elevationM: number; sourceUrl: string; period: string;
    months: { month: number; temperature: number | null; precipitation: number | null }[];
  };
  country: string;
}
const { city, country } = Astro.props;
const summary = climateSummary(city.months);
const station = city.stationName.split(' -')[0];
const format = (value: number | null) => value === null ? '欠測' : value.toFixed(1);
---
<article class="eu-city-card eu-climate-statistic" data-city-card={city.id} hidden={city.id !== 'london'} aria-labelledby={`city-${city.id}`}>
  <header class="eu-statistic-heading">
    <h3 id={`city-${city.id}`}>{city.name}の月別の数値・年間の要約</h3>
    <p>{country} · {city.period}年の平年値 · 観測所 {station}</p>
  </header>
  <div class="eu-climate-statistic-layout">
    <div class="eu-climate-statistic-summary">
      <dl class="eu-summary">
        <div><dt>年間降水量</dt><dd>{summary.annualRain === null ? '欠測のため算出できません' : `${summary.annualRain.toLocaleString('ja-JP', { maximumFractionDigits: 1 })} mm`}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>気温の年較差</dt><dd>{summary.range === null ? '欠測のため算出できません' : `${summary.range.toFixed(1)} ℃`}</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="eu-statistic-note">年間降水量は月別降水量の合計です。気温の年較差は、最も暖かい月と最も寒い月の平均気温の差です。</p>
      <p class="eu-statistic-source">出典：<a href={city.sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">気象庁 ClimatView・{station}の平年値 ↗</a></p>
    </div>
    <details class="eu-months eu-statistic-months" open>
      <summary>月別の数値・観測地点</summary>
      <p>観測所：{station}（地点番号 {city.stationId}）。標高 {city.elevationM.toLocaleString('ja-JP')} m、北緯 {city.coordinates[1]}°／{city.coordinates[0] < 0 ? '西経' : '東経'} {Math.abs(city.coordinates[0])}°です。</p>
      <table>
        <caption>{city.name}・{station}の月別平年値（{city.period}年）</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">月</th><th scope="col">平均気温 ℃</th><th scope="col">降水量 mm</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>{city.months.map(month => <tr><th scope="row">{month.month}月</th><td>{format(month.temperature)}</td><td>{format(month.precipitation)}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
      </table>
      <p>この観測所1地点の値です。都市全体や{country}全体の平均ではありません。</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</article>
